BiscuitSharp is an independent, unofficial .NET integration for Biscuit.
The Biscuit token format, Datalog language, and engine are developed by the
Eclipse Biscuit project and its contributors. BiscuitSharp does not claim
ownership of the Biscuit engine or name.

Native builds use biscuit-auth 6.0.0, licensed Apache-2.0.
Upstream: https://github.com/eclipse-biscuit/biscuit-rust
Source commit: 0f0b4e0e6fe07220c1ba6b51bff21d450d94a975

Native build staging and packages include the licenses and notices of the
resolved Cargo dependencies alongside each native runtime. Preserve those files
when redistributing the native assets. No third-party .NET wrapper code is used.
